00:27:38.152 --> 00:27:39.980
But we're actually
running a fun contest

00:27:39.980 --> 00:27:43.220
at our booth for people that
have never seen a cloud volume,

00:27:43.220 --> 00:27:45.980
don't know what a cloud
volume is, to go spin one up,

00:27:45.980 --> 00:27:50.920
and I think the current
record is around 18 seconds.

00:27:50.920 --> 00:27:53.190
So in addition to being
super simple to provision

00:27:53.190 --> 00:27:56.250
and super simple to
consume, Cloud Volumes

00:27:56.250 --> 00:27:59.160
provides high availability
