I just wanted to give
the audience-- please

00:37:14.870 --> 00:37:16.820
join our pre-release programs.

00:37:16.820 --> 00:37:19.490
A lot of these are
driven by, obviously,

00:37:19.490 --> 00:37:22.490
conversations and feedback
that we get from customers.

00:37:22.490 --> 00:37:24.400
But joining these
pre-release programs

00:37:24.400 --> 00:37:26.150
allows you to provide
feedback, and really

00:37:26.150 --> 00:37:28.010
shape how we do these products.

00:37:28.010 --> 00:37:29.360
Engage with us on Twitter.

00:37:29.360 --> 00:37:31.250
Those are the names up there.

00:37:31.250 --> 00:37:33.170
Please visit us in
the booth, as well.

00:37:33.170 --> 00:37:35.683
We've got most of these demos
and a bunch of subject matter

00:37:35.683 --> 00:37:37.850
